  "releaseNotes": "Breaking. A chain now describes and runs on ExecuteAsync(): And(), On() and Validate() no longer run anything where they are written, so a chain without a final Execute call does nothing. A value interpolated into a string from an earlier step needs the Func overload. ITestStep.ExecuteAsync takes a CancellationToken. Configuration is consolidated into testsettings.json. net7.0 dropped; targets are net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
